# README media: ROOFCAT (the gameplay is the demo player pressing real buttons)
shotscale 2
game roofcat
wait 40
shot roofcat_title
botuntil state == 2 200
botplay 700
gifstart roofcat 3 2
botplay 720
gifstop
shot roofcat_run
