cheat area 1 1
cheat play
botplay 760
shot roofcat_market
cheat area 3 1
cheat play
botplay 420
shot roofcat_harbour
cheat area 4 1
cheat play
cheat arena
botplay 330
shot roofcat_boss
cheat area 0 2
cheat play
